WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.203
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.371
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:05.705
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.407
President Biden has reportedly
met with

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.977
at least three Supreme Court
candidates in the hopes

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:14.214
that one of them will prove
worthy to join the elite group

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:16.549
of the most respected legal
minds in the country

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.085
and Brett Kavanaugh.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.888
President Biden spoke yesterday
from the East Room

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.890
about the Ukraine crisis
and said,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.158
"As Russia contemplates
its next move,

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:28.894
we have our next move
prepared as well."

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:31.798
Spoken like a man
on the fifth row of Wordle

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.967
with only two yellow squares.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.902
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:40.406
I mean, Wordle is hot.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:43.542
Wordle is hot to the touch base.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:44.844
[ Imitates sizzling ]

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.278
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:48.481
Russian lawmakers
voted yesterday

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.149
to give President Vladimir Putin

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.919
the formal approval to use
military force in Ukraine.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.988
Putin said, "The approval came

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.625
with approximately
117% of the vote."

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.828
Pretty good.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:05.365
Could've used Wordle
in that punch line.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.404
Sorry. It's hard
to follow a Wordle joke.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.373
President Biden met yesterday

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.741
with the Ukrainian
Foreign Minister.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:15.942
The meeting wasn't planned.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.444
He just very quickly
decided to move here.

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:20.213
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.448
"Any good restaurants?"

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:24.818
In a new episode
of a right-wing podcast,

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.118
former President Trump said that

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.653
Russian
President Vladimir Putin's

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:31.057
invasion into Ukraine was,
"Genius and wonderful,"

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:33.526
and I got to say,
it's a pretty brilliant way

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.595
to make Putin
second-guess himself.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.229
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:39.698
"Who likes plan?
Oh, boy. This is not good."

00:01:39.698 --> 00:01:42.135
[ Laughter ]
"Genius? Ay, yi, yi."

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:46.872
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.872 --> 00:01:48.875
You -- We fact-checked that,
right?

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.379
We fact-checked that Putin, when
he's upset, says "ay, yi, yi"?

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:54.847
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:56.549
I don't want to be out here
looking like a -- Alright.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:00.920
According to a new report
published in

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.121
"The New York Times" magazine,

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.156
an aide to former President
Trump described

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:05.825
a 2019 White House meeting

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.994
with Supreme Court Justice
Clarence Thomas' wife, Ginni,

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:12.632
as being so crazy that Trump
"tried to reign it in."

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.233
Whoa, you know things are bad

00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:17.770
when Trump is the one
trying to keep things on track.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.705
That's like Bruce Willis
telling the director,

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:22.108
"I feel like this movie
has some plot holes."

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.843
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.645
During a lunch
in Kentucky yesterday,

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.146
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:30.883
said that President Biden is a
"thoroughly decent human being."

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.152
Added McConnell,
"And if it wasn't for that,

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:34.587
we'd probably get along great."

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.589
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:39.025
And finally, a Florida attorney
was recently arrested

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:41.494
after she allegedly stripped
naked in a bar

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:44.563
when they refused to serve her
because she was too drunk.

00:02:44.563 --> 00:02:46.032
And she must be
an amazing lawyer,

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.668
because she still talked them
into a scotch and soda.

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:51.271
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

